    <p>Using <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#f0ede6;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;">sqldf</code> to merge all four year datasets. Each panel shows one year with a linear trend line and Pearson r value.</p>

    <div class="code-block"><pre>gdp_happiness &lt;- <span class="fn">sqldf</span>(<span class="str">"
  SELECT Country, Score, GDP_per_capita, Year
  FROM happiness_all
  WHERE GDP_per_capita IS NOT NULL AND Score IS NOT NULL
"</span>)

r_labels &lt;- gdp_happiness %&gt;%
  <span class="fn">group_by</span>(Year) %&gt;%
  <span class="fn">summarise</span>(r = <span class="fn">round</span>(<span class="fn">cor</span>(GDP_per_capita, Score, use = <span class="str">"complete.obs"</span>), 3)) %&gt;%
  <span class="fn">mutate</span>(label = <span class="fn">paste0</span>(<span class="str">"r = "</span>, r), GDP_per_capita = 1.8, Score = 3.2)</pre></div>

